flowchart TD
    A[Requester signs in] --> B[Complete standardized request form]
    B --> C{Mandatory data valid?}
    C -- No --> D[Show validation messages]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Submit and assign reference]
    E --> F[Route using approved approval matrix]
    F --> G[Authorized human approver reviews]
    G --> H{Decision}
    H -- Approve --> I[Record decision and notify]
    H -- Return --> J[Record reason and request correction]
    J --> B
    I --> K[Update status and audit history]
    K --> L[Dashboard and status view]
